{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的 Planner 规划模块有哪些主流方法？各自适用什么场景？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的规划（Planning）模块有哪些主流方法？如 CoT、ToT、Reflexion 等，各自的原理、优缺点和适用场景是什么？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">规划模块是 Agent 处理复杂任务的核心能力，主流方法从简单到复杂演进：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">规划方法演进路线：\n\nCoT (链式思考) → ToT (思维树) → GoT (思维图) → Reflexion (反思)\n   线性推理        多路径探索        网络结构          自我纠错\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法一：CoT（Chain-of-Thought，思维链）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：引导 LLM 显式生成中间推理步骤，将复杂问题分解为子步骤</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Prompt 技巧</strong>：\"Let's think step by step\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：简单有效，显著提升复杂推理准确率</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：线性推理，一旦某步错误无法回溯</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：数学计算、逻辑推理、单路径问题</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># CoT Prompt 示例</span>\ncot_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n问题：一个农场有鸡和兔，头共35个，脚共94只。鸡兔各几只？\n\n请逐步思考：\nStep 1: 设鸡有 x 只，兔有 y 只\nStep 2: 根据题意列方程：x + y = 35，2x + 4y = 94\nStep 3: 解方程组...\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法二：ToT（Tree of Thoughts，思维树）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：将推理过程建模为树结构，每个节点是一个\"思维\"，可以探索多条路径</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>流程</strong>：生成候选思维 → 评估每个思维的价值 → 选择最有希望的路径继续</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：支持多路径探索、可回溯、适合开放性问题</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：计算成本高，需要多次 LLM 调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：创意生成、策略游戏、需要探索多种方案的问题</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TreeOfThoughts</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"思维树实现\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">solve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> problem<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n              branching_factor<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 根节点：初始问题</span>\n        root <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ThoughtNode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>problem<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> depth <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 获取当前层所有叶子节点</span>\n            leaves <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> root<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_leaves<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> leaf <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> leaves<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> leaf<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_terminal<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span>\n                    \n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 生成多个候选思维（分支）</span>\n                candidates <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate_thoughts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                    leaf<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                    k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>branching_factor\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 评估每个候选的价值</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> candidate <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    candidate<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate_thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>candidate<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 保留 Top-K 最有价值的分支</span>\n                best_candidates <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sorted</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                    candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                    key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                    reverse<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                \n                leaf<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>best_candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回最优路径的答案</span>\n        best_leaf <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>root<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_leaves<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>trace_back<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>best_leaf<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法三：Reflexion（反思）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：Agent 对自己的行为和结果进行评估和反思，从错误中学习</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>三个核心组件</strong>：Actor（执行者）、Evaluator（评估者）、Self-Reflection（自我反思）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：能从失败中学习、持续改进、减少重复错误</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：需要额外的 LLM 调用进行反思，增加延迟</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：代码生成、多步推理、需要高质量输出的任务</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReflexionAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Reflexion: 语言强化学习框架\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>actor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Actor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># 生成行动</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估结果</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflector <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Reflector<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># 生成反思</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>            <span class=\"token comment\"># 存储反思经验</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_trials<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> trial <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_trials<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Actor 执行任务（参考之前的反思经验）</span>\n            trajectory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>actor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>act<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Evaluator 评估结果</span>\n            score<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>success_threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Self-Reflection 生成反思</span>\n            reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflector<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                trajectory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                feedback<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>feedback\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回最佳尝试</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法四：Plan-and-Solve（先规划再解决）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：先让 LLM 生成完整计划，再按步骤执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>变体</strong>：Plan-and-Execute（含动态 replan）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：全局视角，步骤间依赖关系清晰</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：初期计划可能不适应执行中发现的新情况</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：步骤明确、依赖关系清晰的任务</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法五：LLM Compiler（DAG 规划）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：让 LLM 生成有向无环图（DAG），明确任务间依赖关系，并行执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：最大化并行度，显著加速复杂任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：需要准确的依赖分析</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：大规模数据处理、可并行化的复杂工作流</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LLMCompiler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"LLM Compiler - DAG 并行执行\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> DAG<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成任务 DAG\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"将以下任务分解为 DAG，标注依赖关系：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        dag_text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parse_dag<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>dag_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dag<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DAG<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"拓扑排序 + 并行执行\"\"\"</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> layer <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> dag<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>topological_layers<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 按层执行</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 同层任务并行执行</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> ThreadPoolExecutor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                futures <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>submit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> task\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> task <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> layer\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> future <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> as_completed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>futures<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> futures<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>future<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                    results<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> future<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> results\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>方法对比总结：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>CoT</td>\n<td>线性逐步推理</td>\n<td>数学、逻辑推理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ToT</td>\n<td>树状多路径探索</td>\n<td>创意、策略问题</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reflexion</td>\n<td>自我反思纠错</td>\n<td>代码、高质量输出</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plan-and-Solve</td>\n<td>先规划再执行</td>\n<td>流程型任务</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM Compiler</td>\n<td>DAG 并行执行</td>\n<td>大规模并行任务</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如何选择合适的规划方法？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：简单确定性任务用 CoT；需要探索的开放问题用 ToT；要求高质量输出的用 Reflexion；流程固定用 Plan-and-Solve；大规模任务用 LLM Compiler。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：这些规划方法可以组合使用吗？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：可以。如先用 Plan-and-Solve 做全局规划，每个子任务内部用 CoT 或 ToT，最后用 Reflexion 检查质量。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：ToT 一定比 CoT 好</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：ToT 计算成本高，对于确定性问题 CoT 更高效。选择方法要考虑任务特性和成本约束</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}